  "passage": "Dear Students, Our school is organising an exciting winter sports trip to Snowdonia Resort from 10th to 14th February. This is a great chance to enjoy activities like skiing and snowboarding on real slopes. To participate, you must select your choices on the school's online portal. Use your unique password to log in and complete the registration. Packing wisely is key. Bring only necessary luggage to keep things manageable. We recommend warm layers, waterproof jackets, and sturdy boots. Health and safety are priorities; please inform us of any medical conditions. While walking on pavements in the resort area, stay alert and use designated paths. The resort provides comfortable accommodation with cushions on the beds for a good night's sleep. We aim to make this trip unforgettable, so that you can cherish the memories forever. If you have questions, see Mrs. Taylor in the PE department. Best regards, The School Trips Committee",
